- Detached exact-ref worktrees are clean and still equal remote `main`:
  - curator-spec `57c1f56846d221ecc55786bd3c2467ec32f11730`;
  - Curator `17804ceae42d3bb62abf6e8a9d9cbef6dd5370b8`;
