334:<p>Unlike npm, Deno does not run <code>preinstall</code>/<code>postinstall</code> scripts by default: a
335:package's install scripts are a common attack vector, so running them is opt-in.
336:When a dependency genuinely needs its scripts (native addons, for example),
338:<div><div class="markdownBlockTitle"><span aria-label="Terminal" role="img">›_</span></div><div class="relative"><pre><code class="highlight notranslate language-sh">deno <span class="token function">install</span> --allow-scripts<span class="token operator">=</span>npm:better-sqlite3
