149:</samp></pre></figure></p><h1 id="basics">The Basics</h1><h2 id="user-options">User-Provided Options</h2><p>Use <code>b.option</code> to make the build script configurable to end users as well as other projects that depend on the project as a package.</p><p><figure><figcaption class="zig-cap"><cite class="file">build.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class="tok-kw">const</span> std = <span class="tok-builtin">@import</span>(<span class="tok-str">&quot;std&quot;</span>);
