447:</code></pre><p>Note that despite the unconditional call to <code>addExecutable</code>, the build system in fact does not waste any time building the <code>demo</code> executable unless it is requested with <code>-Denable-demo</code>, because the build system is based on a Directed Acyclic Graph with dependency edges.</p><h2 id="dynamic-library">Dynamic Library</h2><p>Here we keep all the files the same from the <a href="#static-library">Static Library</a> example, except the <code>build.zig</code> file is changed.</p><p><figure><figcaption class="zig-cap"><cite class="file">build.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class="tok-kw">const</span> std = <span class="tok-builtin">@import</span>(<span class="tok-str">&quot;std&quot;</span>);
