16-
17:Deno is a full package manager for npm and [JSR](https://jsr.io) packages, built
18-into the `deno` binary. It works with `deno.json`, `package.json`, or both at
19:once, and it is secure by default: npm lifecycle scripts don't run unless you
20-approve them. This page covers the day-to-day workflow; the
21-[toolbelt table](#the-dependency-toolbelt) lists every command.
--
