147:## Lifecycle scripts
148-
149:Unlike npm, Deno does not run `preinstall`/`postinstall` scripts by default: a
150:package's install scripts are a common attack vector, so running them is opt-in.
151:When a dependency genuinely needs its scripts (native addons, for example),
152-allow it explicitly:
153-
154-```sh
155:deno install --allow-scripts=npm:better-sqlite3
156-```
157-
158-Or manage approvals interactively with
159:[`deno approve-scripts`](/runtime/reference/cli/approve_scripts/). Scripts only
160-execute when a `node_modules` directory is in use.
161-
