285:### Overriding NPM packages
286-
287:Deno supports linking npm packages with local versions, similar to how JSR
288:packages can be linked. This allows you to use a local copy of an npm package
289-during development without publishing it.
290-
291:To use a local npm package, configure the `links` field in your `deno.json`:
292-
293-```json
294-{
295-  "links": [
